OL,3,GNEWSAResidents return to homes after
OL,4,Asecurity alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of people have returned to
OL,7,Ftheir homes following a security alert
OL,8,Fin Omagh, County Tyrone.
OL,10,FPolice and Ammunition Technical
OL,11,FOfficers (ATO) were at the scene of the
OL,12,Falert in Gardenville Avenue, which is
OL,13,Foff the Gortin Road.
OL,15,FCordons were in place at the scene of
OL,16,Fthe alert and police had asked the
OL,17,Fpublic to avoid the area.
OL,19,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,20,Fassembly member Tom Buchanan said the
OL,21,Fincident caused "significant
OL,22,Fdisruption".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
